on regions, and I opened SEV3 incident INC-0001 to record the change.\n\n- **Approval:** v2.3.2 had never run in production, so policy required change-manager approval. I sent the deploy through that approval and the change manager approved it.\n- **Deploy:** v2.3.2 replaced v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate. It's running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, the service reports healthy and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open, and opening it paged the on-call engineer. It notes the deploy, the approval and that v2.3.0 is the last version known to be healthy if you need to roll back.", "type": "text"}]}]}